\includegraphics[width=\linewidth]{images/core_comparison/random_proj_sep_all_seeds.png}
\caption{Score distributions for RR2.}
\label{rr2}
\end{figure}

\subsection{Discussion}

Our conclusion is that random rewards based on Eq. \ref{random_rewards} do not result in interesting behavior in the environments we considered. However, there may exist a functional form for random rewards which performs better. 

